          "body": "White was confirmed in October, and the 35-man group he has put together for the November block is the first real measure of his thinking. Fiji come into the Tests off a 34-28 win over Japan and face France, Ireland and Italy, with four uncapped players in the squad. The appointment is aimed at the 2027 World Cup, the bigger horizon beyond these matches."
