          "kicker": "Table watch",
          "heading": "France, third of 12 in the log, have won two of three",
          "body": "The points difference sits at +41, built from a 116-75 scoring split across three matches. The latest result, a 42-15 win over Japan in Round 3, keeps France in a strong position. Fiji come next in Round 4, and the figures suggest the attack will be the main thing to watch when France meet them. Those margins matter in a table this close, where a single result can shift the standings."
