          "heading": "Jimmy O'Brien back in full training ahead of Ireland's Argentina opener",
          "body": "Jimmy O'Brien is back in full training with Ireland after clearing return-to-play protocols following the concussion he suffered in Leinster's win over Munster, a welcome boost before Friday's Nations Championship opener against Argentina at Aviva Stadium. Assistant coach Paul O'Connell said the squad has had \"very few players on the sideline\", a point he tied to the smaller group in camp. Ireland's Sunday statement confirmed the update ahead of next Wednesday's team selection announcement."
