          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Domingo Miotti earns first Italy call-up for South Africa test",
          "body": "Montpellier fly-half Domingo Miotti is in Gonzalo Quesada's 33-man squad for Saturday's test against South Africa in Turin. Eligible through his Italian family and clear under World Rugby's Regulation 8 after his last Argentina test on 9 July 2022, the Tucumán-born playmaker had said he would wait until July and would welcome consideration, the coach says. He was unavailable last week through injury but can now train normally."
