      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad omission",
          "heading": "Magnus Bradbury left out of Scotland squad as Ollie Leatherbarrow preferred",
          "body": "BBC Sport's Andy Burke said on 30 October that he was shocked by the omission and did not see it coming, least of all Leatherbarrow being picked ahead of him. He had flagged Bradbury, who has been very good this season, as a chance for the eight jersey while Jack Dempsey is unavailable in the Six Nations. Burke suggests Bradbury's worst display of the season, against Toulon in the Challenge Cup, came at a bad time, calls him unlucky, and wonders what his future at Test level looks like."
