          "kicker": "Player focus",
          "heading": "Joe Hawkins says he has no regrets over missing the 2023 World Cup",
          "body": "Joe Hawkins, ineligible under the 25-cap rule after swapping the Ospreys for Exeter in 2023, says he has no regrets about missing that tournament. \"I have no regrets,\" he said, adding that it makes him even more excited about what lies ahead. Since returning with the Scarlets he has been Steve Tandy's go-to at 12, starting eight of the last 12 Tests, and he says club intensity rises in a World Cup year as players chase places."
