          "kicker": "Selection debate",
          "heading": "Jeff Wilson slams Kurtley Beale's Wallabies recall after five years away",
          "body": "Wilson's criticism came on Sky Sport NZ after Les Kiss named Beale in the squad for the November Nations Championship games. Wilson, a former All Blacks winger, said of the 95-capped playmaker: \"I love Kurtley Beale as a guy but this is not moving forward, to me it is surprising.\" Kevin Putt agreed Beale could be an option at fly-half but said full-back would be a fantasy. For Australia, the question is whether experience can help build depth at 12 before next year's home World Cup."
